{
  "name": "Your Enquiry to Booked System",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 - CAPTURE AND VALIDATE\n\nOne form, one webhook. Every enquiry is de-duplicated, standardized and checked against GoHighLevel before anything is created.",
        "height": 740,
        "width": 1420,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "3ed1463c-7edb-5469-9673-2c898e2a94cc",
      "name": "Section - 1 - CAPTURE AND VALIDATE",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 - AI QUALIFICATION, NEVER INVENTED\n\nClaude extracts the service, summarizes the enquiry and classifies it. Anything it cannot read is flagged, not guessed.",
        "height": 740,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "e039ca49-c2e3-5ca7-87db-091256eaa22a",
      "name": "Section - 2 - AI QUALIFICATION, NEVER INVENTED",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1580,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 - INTO GOHIGHLEVEL\n\nContact, custom fields, tags, opportunity stage and notes. Sales opens one record and sees the whole enquiry.",
        "height": 740,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "8a3509df-dd51-5d91-9d10-41a232518dda",
      "name": "Section - 3 - INTO GOHIGHLEVEL",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2680,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4 - FOLLOW UP UNTIL THEY REPLY, BOOK OR OPT OUT\n\nApproved messaging and the booking link go out on a sequence that stops itself the moment the lead responds.",
        "height": 740,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "802934e7-69b4-5d09-ace0-b8ac2cc4f1f1",
      "name": "Section - 4 - FOLLOW UP UNTIL THEY REPLY, BOOK OR OPT OUT",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3780,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5 - LOGS, RETRIES AND ALERTS\n\nEvery run writes a log row. A failed step retries once on a delay, then it tells you instead of failing quietly.",
        "height": 740,
        "width": 940,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "ba4e7175-71df-5dc0-9e3e-d2f520679583",
      "name": "Section - 5 - LOGS, RETRIES AND ALERTS",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        4640,
